  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Ciencia y Tecnologa, Finep II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Science  Technology Program, Finep II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM IS A SECOND STAGE OF A SIMILAR PROGRAM UNDER EXECUTION. THE SECOND STAGE COMPRISES: A)SUPPORT TO MOST RELEVANT RESEARCH INSTITUTIONS TO DEVELOP SCIENTIFIC COMPETENCE; B) SUPPORT TECHNOLOGICAL DEVELOPMENT OF PRIVATE SECTOR; AND C) FINEP&apos;S STRENGHTENING TROUGH CAPITALIZATION. THE BANK FINANCING WILL BE EFECTIVE TROUGH A GLOBAL CREDIT LINE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
